{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>First rendering</b><br>חבצלת: a rose." "שושנת: its waves in foreign speech. And it is possible, it is possible that it is so called because it has six leaves." "<b>Second rendering</b><br>For I am now outside, like חבצלת השרון."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:56.757977358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}